# Next.js in this repo

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before changing App Router APIs — this Next version may differ from training data.

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity
- Keep filesystem reads (`@/lib/content`, `@/lib/markdown`) on the server
- Pass data as props into client components (`HomeView`, `GalleryMosaic`, etc.)
- Preserve agent endpoints: `llms.txt`, `profile.md`, `feed.xml`, Accept: markdown on `/`
- After content or route changes, run `npm test`
